# Character System

Two tracks. **Do not mix.**

## Track A — Teo / Kai (photoreal)

- **Teo** — 受, default LEFT, `characters/teo/`
- **Kai** — 攻, default RIGHT, `characters/kai/`

## Track B — Tagame (Japanese anime)

- **Tagame** — 办公室肌肉上司, solo, `characters/Tagame/`
- Skill: `tagame-anime`
- Style: high-quality Japanese anime / digital illustration **always**
- Never photoreal, never Teo/Kai, never `gemini-video` photoreal paste

## Hard rules (Teo/Kai)

1. Character Bible controls face, body, hair, glasses, personality look
2. Scene reference controls composition, pose, environment, lighting only — **match exposure**; do not brighten (over-bright = AI look)
3. NEVER swap Teo and Kai positions or identities
4. NEVER describe identities of people in scene reference photos
5. Use Cursor `GenerateImage` with scene + character reference paths
6. Default output: 3:4 vertical for 小红书
7. **TWO-TURN PROTOCOL:** Turn 1 = analyze + post numbered style options + STOP. Turn 2 = generate after user replies. See `AGENTS.md` and `style-gate.mdc`.
8. **POSE SERIES:** Existing approved still + 系列/换姿态 → `pose-series` skill. Lock identity + outfit + environment; only pose changes. Turn 1 = numbered pose options + STOP.
9. **TEXT SCENE:** Words only, no photo → `text-scene` skill. Fill a complete scene from bibles, post the card, wait; then one image.
10. **GEMINI VIDEO:** Approved still + 图生视频/10秒视频 → `gemini-video` skill. Write a copy-paste Gemini prompt; Japanese kana dialogue. Do **not** call GenerateImage.
11. **XHS CAPTION:** After pose-series (or 文案/标题/标签) → `xiaohongshu-caption`. Names **Teo**（受）/ **Kai**（攻）. Do **not** call GenerateImage.
12. **COVER COLLAGE:** 2+ stills + 拼接/封面图/九宫格 → `cover-collage`. Turn 1 = 3 schemes + copy + STOP. Turn 2 = Pillow `make_cover.py`, one 1080×1440 PNG. **Never** GenerateImage.

## Hard rules (Tagame)

1. Bible + `characters/Tagame/references/face_01.jpeg` lock face, beard, hair, extreme muscle
2. **Anime lock** on every still and every i2v prompt
3. Two-turn: scene card → wait → one still → then 10s video prompt (`docs/anime.md` formula: invite → heat → possession)
4. Direct address to the viewer (`おまえ` / 你). First spoken line at 2.0s
5. Clothes stay on (suit / wet shirt / undone buttons). No Teo/Kai pipeline skills

## User triggers

When user uploads scene + @Teo/@Kai/@virtual-couple → **Turn 1: post options and wait**. Do NOT generate until user confirms choices.

When user points at `outputs/approved/` (or similar) and asks for 系列/换姿态 → **pose-series Turn 1**. Do NOT generate until user picks poses.

When user describes a scene in text with no photo → **text-scene Turn 1**. Do NOT generate until they confirm the filled card.

When user points at an approved still and asks 图生视频 / Gemini视频 / 10秒视频 → **gemini-video**. Write a copy-paste prompt. Do NOT call GenerateImage.

When pose-series finishes, or user asks 文案 / 标题 / 标签 / 小红书发布 → **xiaohongshu-caption**. Copy-paste title + body + tags. Names in copy: Teo / Kai. Do NOT call GenerateImage.

When user has series stills and asks 拼接 / 封面图 / 九宫格 / 拼图 / 首页封面 → **cover-collage Turn 1**. Post 3 schemes + copy and wait. Do NOT run `make_cover.py` or GenerateImage until they pick a scheme.

When user @Tagame / `characters/Tagame` / `docs/anime.md` → **tagame-anime**. Scene card first, wait; then anime still; then 10s i2v prompt. Do NOT generate the still until they confirm the card.
